        "section": "computing-software",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Multi-View Geometry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Properties of F:\n     - 3x3, RANK 2 (det F = 0)        <- one of its singular values is 0\n     - 7 degrees of freedom           (9 entries, -1 scale, -1 rank constraint)\n     - epipoles are its null spaces:  F e1 = 0,   F^T e2 = 0\n     - depends on intrinsics K1,K2 AND the relative pose (uncalibrated)\n```"
    },
